            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>An electrode includes an electrode active material, wherein the electrode active material layer includes an electrode active material, polyvinylidene fluoride, and a conductive agent, wherein the conductive agent includes a carbon nanotube structure in which 2 to 5,000 single-walled carbon nanotube units are bonded to each other. A secondary battery including the same, and a method of preparing the electrode are also provided.</p>
